# ElevenLabs's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-elevenlabs-setting-api-key = An ElevenLabs API key with the user_read permission, from https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys.
usage-elevenlabs-setting-base-url = Optional HTTPS API origin for a proxy. Defaults to https://api.elevenlabs.io.

## The report: character credits, voice slots, and the plan. The plan's
## tier and status, such as Creator Annual or past_due, stay as ElevenLabs
## sends them.

usage-elevenlabs-voice-slots = Voice slots
usage-elevenlabs-professional-voices = Professional voices
# Character credits used this billing month.
usage-elevenlabs-credits = Credits
# $used and $limit are counts, such as 25,000 and 100,000.
usage-elevenlabs-of = { $used } of { $limit }
